== Trivia ==
* Guppy's Eye is one of the few items that will give Isaac a unique costume when two copies are acquired, along with {{i|Brimstone}} and {{i|Glass Eye}}.
* This item was suggested on a Reddit post<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/3x3yl6/guppys_eye/</ref> on the Binding of Isaac Subreddit.
* This item originates from the card game ''The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls''. In it, Guppy's Eye forces all other players to play with their hands face-up on the table.
* Its pickup text is possibly a reference to the description of the Rasmus mask from ''[[wikipedia:Hotline Miami|Hotline Miami]]''.

